Copy to Sheets Privacy Policy
Copy to Sheets reads product information from supported shopping-cart and order pages only when the user clicks an export button.
Information processed may include product names, SKUs or ASINs, quantities, prices, subtotals, product links, and image URLs. This information is processed locally in the user’s browser and copied to the clipboard.
Copy to Sheets:
Does not transmit information to the developer or external servers.
Does not store or retain user information.
Does not sell or share user information with third parties.
Does not collect payment-card details, passwords, authentication credentials, addresses, or personal communications.
Does not use analytics, advertising, or tracking technologies.
Uses information only to provide its spreadsheet-export functionality.
When users paste exported information into Google Sheets or another service, that service’s privacy policy applies.
For privacy questions, contact: privacy.cringing209@passmail.net
Effective date: September 6, 2026
